.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose\",\n            appBuild.contains(\"org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose\"),\n        )\n        assertFalse(\n            \"composeOptions { kotlinCompilerExtensionVersion = ... } is invalid with the Kotlin \" +\n                \"Compose plugin\",\n            appBuild.contains(\"kotlinCompilerExtensionVersion\"),\n        )\n    }\n\n    private fun findProjectRoot(): File {\n        val start = File(System.getProperty(\"user.dir\") ?: \".\").absoluteFile\n        var dir: File? = start\n        while (dir != null) {\n            val current: File = dir\n            if (File(current, \"settings.gradle.kts\").exists() &&\n{\n  \"pi_bin\": \"pi\",\n  \"model\": \"\",\n  \"thinking\": \"medium\",\n  \"tools\": \"\",\n  \"timeout_seconds\": 1500,\n  \"log_tail_lines\": 40,\n  \"ephemeral_sessions\": false,\n  \"offline\": false,\n  \"project_trust\": \"approve\",\n  \"stream_output\": true,\n  \"stream_thinking\": true,\n  \"stream_raw\": false,\n  \"max_attempts\": 3,\n  \"verify_commands\": [\n    \"./gradlew testDebugUnitTest\"\n  ],\n  \"verify_timeout_seconds\": 900,\n  \"verify_env_script\": \"set-env-variables\",\n  \"require_tests\": true,\n  \"source_globs\": [\n    \"app/src/main/*\"\n  ],\n  \"test_globs\": [\n    \"app/src/test/*\",\n    \"app/src/androidTest/*\"\n  ]\n}\n__pycache__\narchived-tasks\nbacklog\nconfig.json\nlogs\nREADME.md\nrules.md\nrunner.py\nselftest.py\nsessions\ntasks\n---\r\nstatus: todo\r\nattempts: 1\r\ntitle: \"Handle Pie Chart clicks\"\r\nsource: backlog.md\r\ndepends_on: nothing\r\n\r\n## Task\r\n\r\nClicking on a specific section of the pie chart should open the transaction history list with that specific category already expanded.\r\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":115,"timestamp":1793736065670}}
