o\r\nattempts: 3\r\ntitle: \"Bug: clicking restore in sidebar has no effect\"\r\nsource: backlog.md\r\ndepends_on: nothing\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Task\r\n\r\nClicking the `Restore` button in the sidebar has no effect. It should open the Restore screen.\r\nMoreover there are now 2 `Restore` buttons to the left and right of the balance box in the Home screen.\r\nThese buttons should not have that functionality, instead when clicked, they should open the transaction history for the month, same behaviour as when clicking the Balance box.\r\nThey should also not have the `Restore` icon, but they should have the 3 horizontal lines `Hamburger` menu icon.\r\n\n</file>\n"}],"timestamp":1793736020258},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me start by exploring the repository structure to understand the codebase.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b7df3adf9f4b45b294a4de35","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /c/p/monefyme && ls && cat .harness-loop/rules.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"strata","model":"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-IQ3-XXS","usage":{"input":473,"output":60,"cacheRead":2630,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":3163,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":false}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1793736020279,"responseId":"chatcmpl-eb1d1ec5a8ac4db5bd7291ee","responseModel":"qwen3.8-flash-next-iq3_xxs","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","durationMs":2895,"thinkingLevel":"off"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b7df3adf9f4b45b294a4de35","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AGENTS.md\napp\nbuild\nbuild.gradle.kts\ngradle\ngradle.properties\ngradlew\ngradlew.bat\nMonefy.Data.29-10-2026.csv\nREADME.md\nset-env-variables.ps1\nset-env-variables.ps1.sample\nset-env-variables.sh.sample\nsettings.gradle.kts\n# Harness-wide rules appended to every Pi session (--append-system-prompt).\r\n# Keep these generic; task-specific detail belong